### Runtime / build artifacts
node_modules/
dist/
*.pyc
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
venv/
.venv/

### Secrets & credentials — NEVER commit
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*credentials*
*secret*
config/local.*

### Infrastructure logs (contain account IDs, ARNs, org metadata)
infrastructure/scripts/*.log

### Backups (may contain TLS keys, raw data)
backups/

### Telemetry exports
trace-export-*.csv
trace-export-*.jsonl

### OS / editor junk
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo
*~

### Private notes
PRIVATE_NOTES.md
ubuntu-mirror.txt

### rapid-prototype scratch (findings, secrets, harness) — never commit
temp/


# Python regression-test virtualenv
tests/python/.venv/

### benchmark run artifacts (keep the dir, ignore results)
bench/results/*.json

bench/prompt_eval/results/*.json

### rendered nginx config — generated from nginx-ssl.conf.template by ops/deploy.sh
### with ORIGIN_SECRET injected from .env.s3. Never commit it (it holds the secret).
nginx/nginx-ssl.conf
